{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>July 1799 \u2014 Moha, Belgium.</strong><br>A priest is found tortured and murdered inside the village presbytery. The scene has been ransacked. Nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of <strong>Captain Gr\u00e9goire Lef\u00e8bvre</strong>, a mounted gendarmerie officer freshly arrived from Auvergne. Investigate a brutal crime that echoes other dark events in the region. The victim was a <i>constitutional priest</i>, loyal to the French Republic \u2014 and despised by many of his flock. Was it a revenge killing? Or something far more sinister?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden motives, face political intrigue, and peel back the secrets of a village on edge. Every witness has something to hide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical mystery</strong> \u2014 Explore real locations in Belgium during the French Directory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate &amp; deduce</strong> \u2014 Question witnesses, search for clues, and piece the puzzle together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced in French</strong> \u2014 Experience an authentic, immersive atmosphere with English &amp; French subtitles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the novel <i>Le Serment de Haine</i></strong>\u00a0by Catherine Lheureux\u2014 Captain Lef\u00e8bvre\u2019s first case.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd <i>Add to your wishlist to support the project!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111040?t=1761923439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111040?t=1761923439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111040/4d8f378b243196870f52e5d21c9bcec0e09f5b67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761923439","capsule_